# SPDX-License-Identifier: OLDAP-2.8
#
# direnv integration for this SDK. One line, on purpose: the canonical
# development environment is the devenv shell defined by devenv.nix and pinned by
# devenv.yaml, and this file says exactly that.
#
#   direnv allow     once, to trust this file
#   devenv shell     equivalent to entering the directory with direnv
#
# There is deliberately no `use flake` here and no second `use` line. A directory
# can only have one environment, and adding a flake fallback would mean the shell
# a developer gets depends on whether they ran `direnv` or `nix develop`. This SDK
# publishes no devShells output at all; see flake.nix and README.md.
use devenv